# HTML Document Design Template

When creating any HTML document (reports, meeting follow-ups, call summaries, proposals, client deliverables, or any standalone HTML file the user requests), use the design system from `web/public/ecg-meeting-followup.html` as the reference template unless the user specifically asks for a different design.

**Before generating an HTML document, always re-read `web/public/ecg-meeting-followup.html` to match its design exactly.**

## Design System Summary

### Font & Base
- Google Font: `Inter` (weights: 300, 400, 500, 600, 700, 800) with system fallbacks
- Body: `line-height: 1.7`, color `#1a1a2e`, white background
- Container: `max-width: 1100px`, `padding: 0 40px`, centered

### Header
- Dark gradient: `linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 40%, #0f172a 100%)`
- Decorative radial gradients (blue top-right, green bottom-left)
- H1: `font-size: 2.8em`, `font-weight: 800`, gradient text (white to `#94a3b8`)
- Subtitle: `font-size: 1.25em`, `rgba(255,255,255,0.75)`
- Header logos bar: uppercase, `letter-spacing: 2px`, muted white
- Meta bar: flex row with label/value pairs, separated by a top border

### Sections
- Padding: `60px 0`, separated by `1px solid #e5e7eb` borders
- Section label: `0.7em`, uppercase, `letter-spacing: 2.5px`, blue `#3b82f6`, `font-weight: 600`
- Section h2: `2em`, `font-weight: 700`, color `#0f172a`
- Body text: `1.05em`, color `#475569`, max-width `800px`

### Component Patterns
- **Summary cards**: 2-column grid, `#f8fafc` background, `12px` border-radius, hover lift effect
- **Highlight box**: gradient background (`#eff6ff` to `#f0fdf4`), blue border, `16px` radius
- **Process steps**: vertical flow with numbered circle indicators (blue gradient), connecting lines
- **Quote blocks**: left blue border, `#f8fafc` background, italic text with attribution
- **Method/option cards**: border cards with colored top accent bars (blue/green/purple)
- **Guide sections**: `#f8fafc` background container with numbered items
- **Action items**: bordered cards with checkbox indicators and colored owner badges
- **Timeline**: horizontal phased flow with colored backgrounds and arrow connectors
- **FAQ items**: simple bordered list with bold question, muted answer
- **CTA section**: dark rounded box (`20px` radius), centered content with contact info

### Color Palette
- Primary dark: `#0f172a`, `#1e293b`
- Text: `#1a1a2e` (primary), `#475569` (body), `#64748b` (muted), `#334155` (medium)
- Accent blue: `#3b82f6`, `#2563eb`, `#1e40af`, `#1d4ed8`
- Accent green: `#10b981`, `#16a34a`, `#166534`
- Accent purple: `#7c3aed`, `#6d28d9`
- Accent amber: `#d97706`, `#ca8a04`, `#92400e`
- Backgrounds: `#f8fafc`, `#f1f5f9`, `#eff6ff`, `#f0fdf4`, `#faf5ff`, `#fefce8`

### Responsive
- Breakpoint at `768px`: single-column grids, reduced padding, stacked timeline

### Footer
- Centered, `padding: 40px 0`, muted text `#94a3b8`, blue links
- Format: `nBrain AI — Confidential [Document Type] — [Month Year]`
